 *		> - `level` must be `GIT_CONFIG_LEVEL_SYSTEM`,
 *		>   `GIT_CONFIG_LEVEL_GLOBAL`, `GIT_CONFIG_LEVEL_XDG`, or
 *		>   `GIT_CONFIG_LEVEL_PROGRAMDATA`.
